  "description": "OEDRO Running Boards for 2007–2021 Toyota Tundra Double Cab. Heavy-Duty Side Steps with Pre-Welded Brackets – Black & Red Drop Step Design. Upgrade your Toyota Tundra with OEDRO’s premium running boards, engineered for strength, style, and convenience. Featuring a unique drop step design, rust-resistant steel construction, and easy no-drill installation, these side steps are built to perform — on and off the road.\nFeatures\nHeavy-Duty Steel Build: Made from high-strength carbon steel with fully welded brackets for unmatched durability and superior rocker panel protection.\nRust & Corrosion Resistant: Finished with a premium powder coating that shields against water, mud, and road salt, keeping your boards looking new.\nEffortless No-Drill Installation : Comes with pre-welded brackets and minimal accessories for a fast, hassle-free setup. No cutting or drilling required.\nStylish Drop Step Design : Features a bold black-and-red finish with a 3.5-inch drop, offering safer and easier access — perfect for kids, seniors, and passengers.\nEasy to Clean & Maintain : Geometric step plate design reduces mud splashes and simplifies cleaning after every off-road adventure.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2007-2021 Toyota Tundra Double Cab.",
